# Issue #18: shell scripts must always be checked out with LF.
# A Windows CRLF checkout of deploy/deploy.sh broke the greencloud webhook
# deploy ("$'\r': command not found", "set: pipefail\r: invalid option name")
# before it could self-heal. Force LF for all shell scripts repo-wide so a
# Windows working copy can never reintroduce CRLF into the committed tree.
*.sh text eol=lf
